ROAST.PET VIRAL FORMAT SCANNER =E2=80=94 NO MATERIAL FORMAT DELTA

STATE
Checked prior SENT Roast.pet Viral Formats =E2=80=94 reports, including the=
 latest
19:33 report, and excluded semantic repeats. Fresh research on September 19
across current meme trackers, TikTok-format reporting, Instagram/Reels
trend reporting, YouTube trending Shorts and Reddit/meme discovery did not
surface a genuinely new reusable mechanism strong enough to add to the
library.

WHAT FRESH EVIDENCE REINFORCED

   - Celebrity look-alike percentage reveals remain active, but this is
   already covered by Pet Archetype Lookalike Percentages.
   - Parent/family split-face resemblance remains active, but this is
   already covered by Pet Family Resemblance / Split-Face DNA Test.
   - Hide-the-boss / visual guessing formats continue to work because
   viewers pause and comment guesses, but this is semantically the same
   mechanism as Hide the Pet / Spot-the-Intruder.
   - Finance-bro parody remains active, but this is already captured by
   Serious Finance-Bro Scheme and absurdly serious pet accounting/review
   structures.
   - Current YouTube Shorts charts continue to reward twist/reveal comedy
   and exaggerated animal spectacle, but neither observation creates a
   sufficiently distinct templatable mechanism by itself.
   - A live meme-template chart on September 19 still shows
   interrogation/reaction/exploitable formats near the top; these map to
   existing interrogation, canonical-pose, reaction-layer and
   serious-monologue templates.

SOURCES
https://meme.com/memes/celebrity-look-alike-trend
